{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras","id":1144192,"title":"Ideas for Homebrewed Dark Eras","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-26T13:54:43-07:00","id":1144192,"title":"Ideas for Homebrewed Dark Eras","content":"Becuase its never too soon to start brainstorming more! Anyhow, I want to try to write up another Dark Era in a couple of months. Does anyone have ideas for Eras they would like to see (or eras they would like to write themselves)? Here are some initial thoughts: <br /> <br /> - Changelings in Kim Il-Sung's North Korea <br /> - Mongol Geist <br /> - Etruscan Mummy/Vampire<br /> - Hunter/Demon Cuban Revolution","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T14:26:51-07:00","id":1144197,"title":"","content":"well, I am currently working on my own First Temple Dark Era, which seems to be a full blown Crossover setting. I would also really like to see (excluding any Eras which were suggested during a Kickstarter) a Third Punic War for Demon/Mummy and the Bar Kokhba Revoult for Promethean/Hunter, and I also have a rough concept for Meiji Restoration Changeling and a mini-Era for the Affairs of Poison for Hunter/Mage. I'll try to think on some more and I'll return to you :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T14:42:45-07:00","id":1144202,"title":"","content":"Well, I've been working on one for about a year and currently bothering my anthropology professor to find good sources to write the second half, so there's that. Still proud and determined about it, as my signature attests.<br /> <br /> Congo aside, I might have some motivation to get on writing that Italian Unification Mummy/Hunter I mentioned sometimes. The Werewolf/Hunter North American Fur Trade is another one and, since I can't get enough Beast, I would be interested in writing a Birth of Psychoanalysis Beast Era almost as much as I am about my Congo Free State one","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T14:55:41-07:00","id":1144204,"title":"","content":"I still think Werewolf Vietnam War is a great idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T15:00:00-07:00","id":1144206,"title":"","content":"Ideas I've previously tossed out: Meiji Werewolf, Mythic Greece Changeling/Beast, 1750s Canada Vampire, 1950s America Promethean, 1930s Shanghai everybody crossover. I have a friend who would give anything for Kowloon Walled City Vampire/Demon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T15:01:41-07:00","id":1144208,"title":"","content":"I still like the idea of Beast/Inferno in the Satanic Panic of the US (80s-90s): The Satanic Panic itself causing violent Heroes to crop up with alarming frequency and the Begotten being hunted, often purely incidentally, while the actual Demonic influences are in Wall Street, the megachurches and the halls of Washington, even using the panic as a cover to push people toward the very institutions they have taken control of.<br /> <br /> There's also an idea I had of a post-WWII Hunter/Mage era that's kind of along the lines of Watchmen, with Mages (mostly Libertines and Arrows) and Hunters emulating the modi operandi of comic-book superheroes, but that might kind of step on the toes of Mage Noir.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T16:05:50-07:00","id":1144222,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:12px\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1144208#post1144208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I still like the idea of Beast/Inferno in the Satanic Panic of the US (80s-90s): The Satanic Panic itself causing violent Heroes to crop up with alarming frequency and the Begotten being hunted, often purely incidentally, while the actual Demonic influences are in Wall Street, the megachurches and the halls of Washington, even using the panic as a cover to push people toward the very institutions they have taken control of.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would be happy to co-write that, or at least act as a researcher for it. Be advised that <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Satans-Silence-Ritual-Making-American/dp/0595189555\" target=\"_blank\">Satan's silence</a>, <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Satanic-Panic-Pop-Cultural-Paranoia-1980s/dp/1903254868\" target=\"_blank\">Satanic Panic: Pop-Cultural Paranoia</a> in the 1980s and <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/We-Believe-Children-Moral-Panic/dp/1610392876\" target=\"_blank\">We believe the Children: </a>a moral panic in the 1980s are mandatory reading for my coauthor. And The <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EcWbuBPNtPw&amp;t=32s\" target=\"_blank\">Geraldo </a>special from during the panic is mandatory viewing for understanding the media's role in this, as is this <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v5LCt94N0BM\" target=\"_blank\">2020 </a>special from the panic and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MhZrpbY4DqQ&amp;t=4s\" target=\"_blank\">this gem </a>shows how wacky the churches could get with it.<br /> <br /> And remember, the bit in the hunter corebook about the Cherion logo is inspired by a smear campaign Amway ran against Proctor and Gamble during the panic.</span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1144206#post1144206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ideas I've previously tossed out: Meiji Werewolf, Mythic Greece Changeling/Beast, 1750s Canada Vampire, 1950s America Promethean, 1930s Shanghai everybody crossover. I have a friend who would give anything for Kowloon Walled City Vampire/Demon.</div> </div> </div> </div>1950s Promethean would be awesome for so many reasons.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1144204#post1144204\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I still think Werewolf Vietnam War is a great idea.</div> </div> </div> </div>In before obligatory Bad Moon Rising joke.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 09-27-2017, 11:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T16:42:47-07:00","id":1144228,"title":"","content":"<b>Deviant</b> in Showa-era Japan, particularly <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cyborg_009_media#Volumes\" target=\"_blank\">between</a> 1964 and 1970. (I thought I'd said this before, but it doesn't seem to have been on these forums.) Not sure which should be the other featured template, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1426-aberranteyes","name":"AberrantEyes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1426_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T17:18:00-07:00","id":1144234,"title":"","content":"Can probably think of more, but what my sleep deprived mind can think of: <br /> <br /> -Golden Age of Hollywood:<ul><li>1920s-40s: Vampire/Changeling</li> <li>McCarthy Red Scare in Hollywood: Beast/Promethean</li> <li>End of the Golden Age (1950s): Demon/Werewolf (working on this one right now)</li> </ul><br /> -Reign of Khmer Rouge: Geist<br /> <br /> -Miami Drug Wars: Werewolf/Hunter<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AberrantEyes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1144228#post1144228\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Deviant</b> in Showa-era Japan, particularly <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cyborg_009_media#Volumes\" target=\"_blank\">between</a> 1964 and 1970. (I thought I'd said this before, but it doesn't seem to have been on these forums.) Not sure which should be the other featured template, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well if we're talking the 60's-70's in Japan, Shotaro Ishinomori, and Deviant, well you simply can't leave out this guy:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://vignette2.wikia.nocookie.net/kamenrider/images/3/3e/Ichigo.png/revision/latest?cb=20140318055208\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> or this guy: <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://vignette2.wikia.nocookie.net/kikaider/images/c/cd/Kikaider_live.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20140329012120\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> <br /> <br /> As for who else to pair them up with...easy, Beasts as kaiju. Godzilla is supposed to be a metaphor for the fear of nuclear annihilation, after all. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T18:07:58-07:00","id":1144244,"title":"","content":"Dark Eras I want to write sone day:<br /> - Spanish Civil War Geist.<br /> - Mexican Porfiriate Vampire<br /> - Al-Andalus Mage<br /> - Tartessos crossover","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>LAND OF THE DAMNED: SPAIN (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/3MHWYm\" target=\"_blank\">Land of the Damned: Spain</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/52b0TX\" target=\"_blank\">Kingdoms of Blood: Spain</a>; Cities of the Damned: <a href=\"https://goo.gl/XFMSSe\" target=\"_blank\">Barcelona</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/AXxdgq\" target=\"_blank\">Valencia</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/zkI5a1\" target=\"_blank\">Carthian Constitution</a> (1812), <a href=\"https://goo.gl/5H8M4s\" target=\"_blank\">Three Arrows Pact</a>: <br /> <br /> <b>OTHERS (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/36HngB\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: The Redemption</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/6B9V8l\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Forgotten</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/247-uxas","name":"Uxas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-26T19:06:48-07:00","id":1144252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1144234#post1144234\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can probably think of more, but what my sleep deprived mind can think of:Well if we're talking the 60's-70's in Japan, Shotaro Ishinomori, and Deviant, well you simply can't leave out this guy:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://vignette2.wikia.nocookie.net/kamenrider/images/3/3e/Ichigo.png/revision/latest?cb=20140318055208\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>I didn't have him specifically in mind while I was making my post, but I've thought of him and his successors in this connection. (In fact, before we learned <b>Deviant</b>'s official subtitle, I half-jokingly called it <b>Deviant: The Kamen-Ridering</b>.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> or this guy:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://vignette2.wikia.nocookie.net/kikaider/images/c/cd/Kikaider_live.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20140329012120\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> </div> </div> </div>I must admit he, on the other hand, didn't occur to me but probably should've.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As for who else to pair them up with...easy, Beasts as kaiju. Godzilla is supposed to be a metaphor for the fear of nuclear annihilation, after all. </div> </div> </div>I actually thought of Beasts (albeit not specifically as kaiju), but without the rationale, they seemed too obvious. (The big fellow himself is, of course, an Anakim Nemesis.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1426-aberranteyes","name":"AberrantEyes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1426_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T07:58:19-07:00","id":1144412,"title":"","content":"I'll second Werewolf Vietnam and Werewolf in the Belgian Congo a thousand times over. Both very interesting premises that would require a very deft touch. Ditto Red Scare Beast/Promethean and 80s Miami Hunter (As a matter of fact, I've built a pretty comprehensive setting for the latter, and I'm trying to get together a group to run it right now. I actually have half a mind to convert it into a proper fan supplement). I actually think most of the ideas on this thread are REALLY great, but those are the ones that most appeal to me personally.<br /> <br /> I'd also add:<br /> Demon in post-Soviet, early 90s Russia<br /> Changeling in the Reconstruction South<br /> Promethean in pre-WWII Munich (around the time of Kristallnacht)<br /> <br /> and maybe:<br /> Geist in Haiti during the rule of &quot;Papa Doc&quot;<br /> Vampire and Geist in pre-revolution Cuba","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8492,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","user":"dxanders","date":". 09-27-2017, 11:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8492-dxanders","name":"dxanders","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-27T08:48:31-07:00","id":1144442,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1144234#post1144234\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can probably think of more, but what my sleep deprived mind can think of:[*]McCarthy Red Scare in Hollywood: Beast/Promethean<br /> -Miami Drug Wars: Werewolf/Hunter</div> </div> </div> </div>Miami drug wars hunter/werewolf sounds good, and is in the same time period as malonkey and I's idea, so I like that.<br /> <br /> And given Mcarthy's red scare as a preceding moral panic in the US, and the shared involvement of the media and government in the two panics, I also would recommend Satan's Silence for that one too, given that the first few chapters discuss the science of moral panics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 09-27-2017, 11:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-04T22:18:26-07:00","id":1146908,"title":"","content":"The Early 90s.<br /> <br /> Basically the High Concept being a homage to the Original World of Darkness in its heyday as well as what would it be like if Chronicles of Darkness came out first.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12476-voltron64","name":"Voltron64","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T18:11:59-07:00","id":1147629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1144202#post1144202\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Werewolf/Hunter North American Fur Trade is another one</div> </div> </div> </div>Werewolf: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beaver_Wars\" target=\"_blank\">The Beaver Wars</a>?<br /> <br /> I'm pondering New South Wales circa 1790, but unsure which game it might fit with.<br /> <br /> Also the western areas of modern Germany during the Renaissance, when the printing press was invented. Maybe a Mage/Demon thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":12890,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","user":"No One of Consequence","date":". 10-06-2017, 09:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-06T18:18:15-07:00","id":1147631,"title":"","content":"The hunting ground for the Red Centre in Australia suggested a particularly interesting past for the Uratha there, dominated likely by one of the Firstborn. It would be interesting to see their world perhaps as it has its first interactions with the 'regular' ones.<br /> <br /> I'm big on the clash of cultures, though. Still for the South American and African colonizations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T07:54:50-07:00","id":1147765,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1144222#post1144222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1950s Promethean would be awesome for so many reasons.</div> </div> </div> </div>Though I think 50's Soviet Union would be better than 50's America.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uxas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1144244#post1144244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spanish Civil War Geist.</div> </div> </div> </div>In the past, I've suggested this for Vampire - but it would make a good mix<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T09:00:37-07:00","id":1147786,"title":"","content":"I can't remember .. did they do the Vietnam War? Werewolves and Demon perhaps?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/722-walksforever","name":"Walksforever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar722_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T10:40:19-07:00","id":1147815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Walksforever</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1147786#post1147786\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can't remember .. did they do the Vietnam War? Werewolves and Demon perhaps?</div> </div> </div> </div>They did not. Werewolves got 70s New York in the Bowery Dogs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T10:49:44-07:00","id":1147822,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1147815#post1147815\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They did not. Werewolves got 70s New York in the Bowery Dogs.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ahh ..ok. Well ... Werewolves in the jungles of Vietnam would work .. Demons might work for all the political and secret service crap that was going on in the background .. Beast maybe, hidden in the jungles preying on the villages or on the invading troops .. Sin Eaters or Hunters might work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/722-walksforever","name":"Walksforever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar722_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T12:56:13-07:00","id":1147856,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1147765#post1147765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the past, I've suggested this for Vampire - but it would make a good mix</div> </div> </div> </div>I've half written a setting for it. It's not a Dark Era, is a sourcebook for Spain, but I detailed it so much, that there's enough info for at least a Flashpoint (from Ancient Mysteries).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>LAND OF THE DAMNED: SPAIN (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/3MHWYm\" target=\"_blank\">Land of the Damned: Spain</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/52b0TX\" target=\"_blank\">Kingdoms of Blood: Spain</a>; Cities of the Damned: <a href=\"https://goo.gl/XFMSSe\" target=\"_blank\">Barcelona</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/AXxdgq\" target=\"_blank\">Valencia</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/zkI5a1\" target=\"_blank\">Carthian Constitution</a> (1812), <a href=\"https://goo.gl/5H8M4s\" target=\"_blank\">Three Arrows Pact</a>: <br /> <br /> <b>OTHERS (Spanish): </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/36HngB\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: The Redemption</a>, <a href=\"https://goo.gl/6B9V8l\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Forgotten</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/247-uxas","name":"Uxas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar247_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T14:52:57-07:00","id":1147872,"title":"","content":"1970s-1990s Boston: Mage/Hunter: Southie Stories: The infamous mob war that ripped the city apart and exposed the corruption in the FBI's offices for the world to see.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T19:44:56-07:00","id":1147913,"title":"","content":"Geist/Changeling during a Mars colonization period.<br /> <br /> I'd love to see the Satanic Panic era, but I'd like to see <i>Descent</i> in that era. Setting Descent during eras of paranoia and Cold War-isms feels a lot like low hanging fruit.<br /> <br /> Promethean: Orlando would be neat. The theme parks and nearby tech havens are really heavy into robotics around here. I've done Orlando Demon using the attractions and some of the weirder rumors around town, they'd be cool to cast into Promethean and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x9ShJ1NZ0F4\" target=\"_blank\">possibly Mage</a> (there's a lot of occult rumors about the attractions).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-07T22:52:26-07:00","id":1147934,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>raygungoth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1147913#post1147913\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd love to see the Satanic Panic era, but I'd like to see <i>Descent</i> in that era. Setting Descent during eras of paranoia and Cold War-isms feels a lot like low hanging fruit.</div> </div> </div> </div>Perhaps...But I don't know if the kind of paranoia in Demon is really the sort of moral panic that the Satanic Panic brings to mind. I think you could certainly fit them, but it doesn't seem like a totally natural fit at first glance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-08T04:24:08-07:00","id":1147972,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SunlessNick</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1147765#post1147765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Though I think 50's Soviet Union would be better than 50's America.</div> </div> </div> </div>Though, if you're doing Soviet Promethean, wouldn't you just go with the era of the Great Purges?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-08T04:37:25-07:00","id":1147974,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1147972#post1147972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Though, if you're doing Soviet Promethean, wouldn't you just go with the era of the Great Purges?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because sometimes a stable era with proper themes is more interesting than an unstable era. Just as Promethean is &quot;what does it mean to be human and can I get there?&quot;, 1950s is the first introspective period in Soviet Russia; when they started to ask &quot;what does it mean to be communist and can I get there?&quot;, especially in the Kruschev era. The Purges were more straightforward with-us-or-against-us, not very complementary themes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2291-gwyn-chan-r-gwyll","name":"Gwyn chan 'r Gwyll","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-08T06:43:02-07:00","id":1147987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1147934#post1147934\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Perhaps...But I don't know if the kind of paranoia in Demon is really the sort of moral panic that the Satanic Panic brings to mind. I think you could certainly fit them, but it doesn't seem like a totally natural fit at first glance.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree, the satanic panic wasn't so much paranoia so much as it was a moral panic, one partly set off by various anxieties of 80s America and by bad science that created false accusations via coercive interviewing techniques.<br /> <br /> seriously, that book I keep mentioning, satan's silence? read it, it explains the whole thing better than I could.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-08T06:44:32-07:00","id":1147988,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gwyn chan 'r Gwyll</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1147974#post1147974\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because sometimes a stable era with proper themes is more interesting than an unstable era. Just as Promethean is &quot;what does it mean to be human and can I get there?&quot;, 1950s is the first introspective period in Soviet Russia; when they started to ask &quot;what does it mean to be communist and can I get there?&quot;, especially in the Kruschev era. The Purges were more straightforward with-us-or-against-us, not very complementary themes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, but SunlessNick was directly comparing it to 50s USA. The implication I took was that the themes present in such an era would be better served in the USSR. I guess i jumped to the conclusion that it was the paranoia element that was being discussed.<br /> <br /> That said, Prometheans suffering from being perpetual outsiders is a central theme of the game, and that fear of outsiders is a big element in sparking the mass operations that actually killed most of the victims of the purges.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-08T14:46:40-07:00","id":1148128,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The young man in the cafe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1147987#post1147987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I agree, the satanic panic wasn't so much paranoia so much as it was a moral panic, one partly set off by various anxieties of 80s America and by bad science that created false accusations via coercive interviewing techniques.<br /> <br /> seriously, that book I keep mentioning, satan's silence? read it, it explains the whole thing better than I could.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bad science, false accusations, coercive techniques? Implanted memories? The potential for horrible things to actually be happening in the background using fake panic as a cover? The potential for cults and God playing all sides to create moral confusion? It's a perfect pitch for Descent. God is constantly pushing on religions already because they provide almost perfect cover - you can get a believer to do anything for almost no reason at all, and they're almost always socially acceptable, especially when they're crusading against a &quot;fake&quot; evil. At the same time, you get to demonize, well, demons.<br /> <br /> Moral panic, occult symbolism, and fear of media plays very well into the themes of Descent.<br /> <br /> You might be able to sneak some Deviant in there, too. After all, the 80s and 90s were the period of the heavy duty body horror and occult flicks that were a large component of the panic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4170-raygungoth","name":"raygungoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-08T15:03:59-07:00","id":1148130,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>raygungoth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1148128#post1148128\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Bad science, false accusations, coercive techniques? Implanted memories? The potential for horrible things to actually be happening in the background using fake panic as a cover? The potential for cults and God playing all sides to create moral confusion? It's a perfect pitch for Descent. God is constantly pushing on religions already because they provide almost perfect cover - you can get a believer to do anything for almost no reason at all, and they're almost always socially acceptable, especially when they're crusading against a &quot;fake&quot; evil. At the same time, you get to demonize, well, demons.<br /> <br /> Moral panic, occult symbolism, and fear of media plays very well into the themes of Descent.<br /> <br /> You might be able to sneak some Deviant in there, too. After all, the 80s and 90s were the period of the heavy duty body horror and occult flicks that were a large component of the panic.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like what you are saying here, don't get me wrong, but my plan for 80s demon was more focused on 1985, AKA the year of the spy, in which a number of soviet agents in the US intelligence rose were arrested right as Gorbachev became leader of the soviet union, complicating US-Soviet relations at a crucial time.And of course, the GM is pushing all this along to pursue it's plans for the end of the cold war, plans that not only the unchained would want to see fail if only they knew of them...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-09T04:04:30-07:00","id":1148267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1144192-ideas-for-homebrewed-dark-eras?p=1147988#post1147988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That said, Prometheans suffering from being perpetual outsiders is a central theme of the game, and that fear of outsiders is a big element in sparking the mass operations that actually killed most of the victims of the purges.</div> </div> </div> </div>Certainly, though I'd argue there was enough of it to be going on with in the 50's too. But my own conclusion I jump to when I hear &quot;50's Promethean&quot; is that the speaker is also after the nuclear aspect, and shifting to an earlier decade loses that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-11T03:17:47-07:00","id":1148782,"title":"","content":"so, here is my Dark Era homebrew/wishlist, with each Era including crossover between two gamelines-<br /> <br /> <b>Second Punic War</b>- Demon/Mummy (the legions of Rome and the armies of Carthage wage war over the future of Western Civilization)<br /> <b>Rise of Modern Medicine</b>- Deviant/Werewolf (the Rabies panic mixed with the medical experiments of a new scientific understanding of medicine)<br /> <b>Meiji Restoration</b>- Changeling/Mage (restoration of power to the Emperor and the Onmyodo's collapse)<br /> <b>Bar Kokhba Revolt</b>- Promethean/Hunter (the fall of the revolt as a failed New Dawn and the desperate hope to fight an enemy you can't defeat)<br /> <b>Fall of Axum-</b> Geist/Beast (the violence generated from Gudit's war against Axum, leading to the collapse of an almost eternal dynasty)<br /> <b>Italian </b><b>Renaissance</b>- Vampire/Inferno (Italian politics and trade rivalry between city states and Europe's finale rise from a fallen and corrupted state)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-14T12:53:19-07:00","id":1149767,"title":"","content":"After watching the first two parts of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Red_Riding\" target=\"_blank\">Red Riding trilogy</a>, I'm convinced that mid-70s Yorkshire would be a pretty good setting for dark, depressing and noir influenced chronicles. Promethean, reflecting the industrial decay and economic problems, and maybe the Chapeltown race riots; Geist and Hunter for the Yorkshire Ripper murders and other killings; Mage: Noir for the general atmosphere and corruption; probably some Hunter and Changeling angles as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-14T20:06:14-07:00","id":1149835,"title":"","content":"Are alternate history scenarios valid?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"",